	(text "AMPLIFIER BANK - 8 CANALES\n\nContiene 8x PAM8302A (mono Class-D filterless)\nCada PAM8302A amplifica 1 canal diferencial\n\nCircuito por PAM8302A:\n\n  PCM1690 VOUT+ --[0.1uF]-- IN+\n                                   PAM8302A     VO+ --- Speaker +\n  PCM1690 VOUT- --[0.1uF]-- IN-   (MSOP-8)     VO- --- Speaker -\n\n  +5V ---- VDD ---- SD (enable)\n  GND ---- GND\n  [10uF + 1uF] bypass en VDD\n\nComponentes por IC:\n- 2x Cap 0.1uF (coupling entrada IN+/IN-)\n- 1x Cap 10uF (bypass VDD baja freq)\n- 1x Cap 1uF (bypass VDD alta freq)\n\nTotal por banco: 8 ICs + 32 pasivos"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130.81 141.224 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "053d713b-e656-4bbf-b789-86bf51b71b5a")
	)
	(text "PAM8302A Pinout (MSOP-8):\n\n Pin 1: SD   (shutdown, HIGH=on)\n Pin 2: NC   (no connect)\n Pin 3: IN+  (entrada diferencial +)\n Pin 4: IN-  (entrada diferencial -)\n Pin 5: VO+  (salida BTL +)\n Pin 6: VDD  (2.5V - 5.5V)\n Pin 7: GND\n Pin 8: VO-  (salida BTL -)\n\nPotencia: ~1.5W @ 8ohm/5V\nEntrada: Diferencial verdadera\nSalida: BTL (no conectar parlante a GND)\n\nLCSC: C113367 (PAM8302AASCR, Diodes Inc)\nPrecio: ~$0.10/u\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 70.866 135.128 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8e21424b-ede5-4dac-b098-16b2ae187c92")
	)
